OL,3,GNEWSAAbandoned store to become shopping
OL,4,Aarcade and flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA department store which closed more
OL,7,Fthan five years ago and has remained
OL,8,Fempty ever since, could now be
OL,9,Ftransformed into a new shopping arcade
OL,10,Fand flats.
OL,12,FThe 7,815 sq m (84,127 sq ft) former
OL,13,FDebenhams store sits over five floors
OL,14,Fin a prominent location in Taunton's
OL,15,Ftown centre.
OL,17,FDevelopers said they want to build a
OL,18,Fnew shopping arcade in the ground
OL,19,Ffloor, then add flats on the floors
OL,20,Fabove, and install an underground car
OL,21,Fpark.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
