OL,3,GNEWSAAbandoned store to become shopping
OL,4,Aarcade and flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Tom Deakin, the head of
OL,7,FTaunton Town Council, said he was
OL,8,F"really excited" about the prospect of
OL,9,Fthe building coming back into use.
